<title>SPAIN: Cepsa's first half net profit falls 20.5 pct.</title>
<headline>Cepsa's first half net profit falls 20.5 pct.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1996-08-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results for six months to June 30, 1996 in billions of pesetas, unless stated:</p>
<p> Net taxed group			 9.194    vs    11.563</p>
<p> Turnover group			547.773    vs   515.915</p>
<p> Parent co net profit		  5.377    vs     6.115</p>
<p> Parent co turnover		  421.096    vs   403.142</p>
<p>NOTE - Oil firm Cepsa said the rise in crude prices had not been reflected in the end prices of its products in Spain and therefore its margins had fallen.</p>
</text>
